---
// A big line worth repeating. Usage in .mdx: <PullQuote>A line worth repeating.</PullQuote>
---

<blockquote class="pull-quote"><p><slot /></p></blockquote>

<style>
  .pull-quote {
    margin: 56px 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .pull-quote p,
  .pull-quote :global(p) {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pull-quote {
      margin: 40px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
